<% content_for :title, "About" %>

<!-- Intro -->
<section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
  <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-emerald-600">About Mas Futbol</p>
  <h1 class="mt-4 text-5xl font-black leading-tight md:text-6xl">
    Football shirts with a <span class="text-emerald-600">story.</span>
  </h1>
  <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-zinc-600">
    Mas Futbol sells retro and replica jerseys from the clubs, countries, and eras that
    made the game what it is, picked one at a time by someone who actually wears them.
  </p>
</section>

<!-- Story -->
<section class="mt-20 grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
  <div class="flex aspect-square items-center justify-center rounded-3xl bg-zinc-950 text-[8rem]">
    ⚽
  </div>
  <div>
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-black">How it started</h2>
    <div class="mt-5 space-y-4 leading-relaxed text-zinc-600">
      <p>
        [Your story: when you got into football shirts, what first got you collecting,
        and how that turned into selling.]
      </p>
      <p>
        Mas Futbol started on Depop and grew from there. Every jersey is listed
        individually, described honestly, and shipped with care.
      </p>
      <p>
        [What makes your shop different: the eras you love, the leagues you focus on,
        or the kind of buyer you're shopping for.]
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Values -->
<section class="mt-20">
  <h2 class="text-center text-3xl font-black">What you can count on</h2>
  <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 p-8">
      <p class="text-3xl">🔎</p>
      <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-bold">Honest listings</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-zinc-600">Retro or replica, size and condition are always stated clearly. No surprises when it arrives.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 p-8">
      <p class="text-3xl">📦</p>
      <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-bold">Checked before shipping</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-zinc-600">Every kit gets looked over before it goes out the door.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 p-8">
      <p class="text-3xl">🔒</p>
      <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-bold">Secure checkout</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-zinc-600">Payments are handled by Stripe. Your card details never touch this site.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Call to action -->
<section class="mt-20 rounded-3xl bg-zinc-950 px-8 py-16 text-center text-white">
  <h2 class="text-3xl font-black md:text-4xl">Find your next kit.</h2>
  <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-zinc-300">New drops are added regularly, and most are one of one, so when they're gone, they're gone.</p>
  <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
    <%= link_to "Shop the drops", jerseys_path,
          class: "rounded-full bg-emerald-500 px-6 py-3 font-bold text-zinc-950 transition hover:bg-emerald-400" %>
    <%= link_to "Find us on Depop", "#",
          class: "rounded-full border border-zinc-700 px-6 py-3 font-bold transition hover:border-zinc-400" %>
  </div>
</section>